<title>UK: TENNIS-QUEEN'S GRASS-COURT MEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-QUEEN'S GRASS-COURT MEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results at the Queen's</p>
<p>grass-court men's tennis tournament on Thursday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Second round:</p>
<p>7-Jim Courier (U.S.) beat David Nainkin (South Africa) 6-3 6-2</p>
<p>8-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Luis Herrera (Mexico) 7-5 7-5</p>
<p>Third round:</p>
<p>16-Greg Rusedski (Britain) beat Scott Draper (Australia) 6-3</p>
<p>6-2</p>
<p>3-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) beat Martin Lee (Britain) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Jerome Golmard (France) beat Jean-Philippe Fleurian (France)</p>
<p>2-6 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>6-Mark Philippoussis (Australia) beat Byron Black (Zimbabwe)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Add third round:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat Brett Steven (New Zealand)- walkover</p>
<p>8-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Stephane Simian (France) 6-4 7-5</p>
<p>Jens Knippschild (Germany) beat 4-Tim Henman (Britain) 7-6</p>
<p>(7-5) 6-3</p>
<p>9-Patrick Rafter (Australia) beat 7-Jim Courier (U.S.) 4-6 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
</text>
